    },
    "counting_scope": "Actual compact source-context envelope including full original source metadata and all model-facing task/item bindings. Audit-only logs are separate and never smuggled into the model context.",
    "scheduler": "Interleave item lists by task and item input order; one candidate per item visit; reuse order for subsequent rounds.",
    "duplicate_root": "No new root slot, but additional binding tokens still count.",
    "non_fitting_bundle": "Do not consume an admitted-root slot; log budget failure for affected units and continue other candidates/items without truncating a dependency.",
    "stop": "Stop when all supported units are covered, or all item candidate queues are exhausted. Never revisit an already considered candidate for the same item.",
    "bundle": "Ordered inherited dependency closure of candidate roots, followed by ordered inherited dependency closure of required_guard_source_ids, deduplicated at first appearance. All guards mandatory. Traverse declared requires in array order depth-first, dependencies before their root. Process root_source_ids in declared array order."
